# The shell and the counter, the counter below it (roadmap l4.md L2): the
# shell answers as ever, and the counter runs whenever the shell waits.
program: shell
define: TEST_THREAD_REPORT
keys: echo hello\n
---
rx286, test build
rx286 shell: type help for the commands
A:\>echo hello
hello
A:\>
rx286: thread root ran
rx286: thread program ran
rx286: thread counter ran
rx286: thread os ran
rx286: thread os ran
